                <pb facs="0602" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg500"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 17172/12.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Ambassador Griscom.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-12-31"><hi rendition="#italic">December 31,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Regret no warships could reach Italy before the arrival of the fleet in those
                    waters about January 14, about which we will cable you further. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Scorpion</hi> ordered last night from Constantinople.
                    You may possibly find her of use in rendering assistance to American citizens or
                    others in distress or to facilitate communication. Telegram 31st received. May
                    draw for $5,000 if necessary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
